  "summary": "The documents ranked directly address the application of representation learning with paired positive and negative examples to agricultural yield estimation. Studies by Brennan et al. [V0048], Adebayo et al. [V0047], Gupta et al. [V0045], and Haddad et al. [V0046] explicitly apply this contrastive learning method to the target domain. Reported results vary by dataset, with Brennan et al. [V0048] reporting an F1 of 0.83 on ToxiBench and Adebayo et al. [V0047] achieving an AUROC of 0.76 on CellLife. Gupta et al. [V0045] report an accuracy of 0.62 on AgriSat-4, while Haddad et al. [V0046] report a test MAE of 0.69 on LedgerGuard. Document [V0094] is included as a methodologically relevant baseline applying the same technique to a different domain.",
